{"seq":1,"slug":"color-temperature","title":"色温与光源特性","url":"/l-doc-books/h/photography-video/color-science/white-balance/color-temperature","wordCount":1364,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"色温与光源特性\">色温与光源特性</h1><h2 id=\"概述\">概述</h2><p>色温（Color Temperature）是用绝对温度（开尔文，K）描述光源颜色的物理量——它源自黑体辐射理论：一个理想黑体被加热到特定温度时发出的光的颜色。从 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1800</mn><mi>K</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1800K</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1800</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span></span></span></span></span> 的烛光暖黄到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>10000</mn><mi>K</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10000K</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">10000</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span></span></span></span></span> 的蓝天冷蓝，色温为我们提供了一个将&quot;颜色感觉&quot;量化为数字的框架。理解色温是掌握白平衡的物理基础。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    A[&quot;1800K&lt;br/&gt;烛光&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;2700K&lt;br/&gt;钨丝灯&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; C[&quot;3200K&lt;br/&gt;卤素灯&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; D[&quot;4100K&lt;br/&gt;荧光灯&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; E[&quot;5500K&lt;br/&gt;正午日光&quot;]&#10;    E --&gt; F[&quot;6500K&lt;br/&gt;阴天&quot;]&#10;    F --&gt; G[&quot;7500K&lt;br/&gt;阴影&quot;]&#10;    G --&gt; H[&quot;10000K+&lt;br/&gt;蓝天&quot;]\">flowchart LR\n    A[\"1800K&lt;br/&gt;烛光\"] --&gt; B[\"2700K&lt;br/&gt;钨丝灯\"]\n    B --&gt; C[\"3200K&lt;br/&gt;卤素灯\"]\n    C --&gt; D[\"4100K&lt;br/&gt;荧光灯\"]\n    D --&gt; E[\"5500K&lt;br/&gt;正午日光\"]\n    E --&gt; F[\"6500K&lt;br/&gt;阴天\"]\n    F --&gt; G[\"7500K&lt;br/&gt;阴影\"]\n    G --&gt; H[\"10000K+&lt;br/&gt;蓝天\"]</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>色温看似只是一个数字，其背后是四个相互关联的核心概念：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>色温源自黑体辐射</strong>：理想黑体加热到某温度时发出的光色即为该温度的色彩，普朗克定律 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>λ</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>T</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B(\\lambda, T)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 给出完整光谱分布。</li>\n<li><strong>CCT 是&quot;最接近的黑体温度&quot;</strong>：实际光源不在普朗克轨迹上，相关色温（Correlated Color Temperature）描述其最接近的黑体温度。</li>\n<li><strong>Duv 补足色温描述不了的信息</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mrow><mi>u</mi><mi>v</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta_{uv}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">uv</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 描述光源偏离黑体轨迹的方向与幅度（偏绿或偏品红），只有色温 + Duv 才能完整描述一个光源的色彩。</li>\n<li><strong>显色性衡量&quot;还原能力&quot;</strong>：CRI 与更先进的 TM-30（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>f</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R_f</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 保真度、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>g</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R_g</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 色域面积）评价光源对标准色样的还原程度，是选灯的关键指标。</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"黑体辐射与色温定义\">黑体辐射与色温定义</h2><h3 id=\"普朗克辐射定律\">普朗克辐射定律</h3><p>黑体辐射的光谱功率分布由普朗克定律决定：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>λ</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>T</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>h</mi><msup><mi>c</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><msup><mi>λ</mi><mn>5</mn></msup></mfrac><mo>⋅</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mi>h</mi><mi>c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>λ</mi><msub><mi>k</mi><mi>B</mi></msub><mi>T</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B(\\lambda, T) = \\frac{2hc^2}{\\lambda^5} \\cdot \\frac{1}{e^{hc/(\\lambda k_B T)} - 1}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.1771em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.4911em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7401em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.989em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">5</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.1088em;vertical-align:-0.7873em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.296em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.814em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.989em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">/</span><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">λ</span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3567em;margin-left:-0.0315em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1433em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7873em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>h</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">h</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span></span></span></span></span> 是普朗克常数，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span></span> 是光速，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>k</mi><mi>B</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k_B</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0315em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是玻尔兹曼常数，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span> 是绝对温度。</p>\n<h3 id=\"相关色温-cct\">相关色温（CCT）</h3><p>实际光源并非完美黑体——它们的色度坐标不在普朗克轨迹上。相关色温（Correlated Color Temperature）是该光源在色度图上<strong>最接近的</strong>黑体温度：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>CCT</mtext><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>blackbody</mtext></msub><mtext> where </mtext><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mrow><mi>u</mi><mi>v</mi></mrow></msub><mtext> is minimized</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{CCT} = T_{\\text{blackbody}} \\text{ where } \\Delta_{uv} \\text{ is minimized}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">CCT</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9805em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">blackbody</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> where </span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">uv</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> is minimized</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>光源</th>\n<th>色温 (K)</th>\n<th><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mrow><mi>u</mi><mi>v</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta_{uv}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">uv</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></th>\n<th>光谱特征</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>白炽灯</td>\n<td>2700</td>\n<td>~0</td>\n<td>连续光谱（接近黑体）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>日光</td>\n<td>5500</td>\n<td>~0.003</td>\n<td>连续（大气吸收线）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>荧光灯</td>\n<td>4100</td>\n<td>0.005-0.02</td>\n<td>线状光谱+荧光</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>LED (暖白)</td>\n<td>3000</td>\n<td>0.002-0.01</td>\n<td>蓝峰+荧光粉宽带</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>LED (冷白)</td>\n<td>6500</td>\n<td>0.002-0.01</td>\n<td>蓝峰+荧光粉</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"duv-色温之外的绿紫偏移\">Duv：色温之外的绿紫偏移</h3><p>色温只描述黑体轨迹上的位置，而 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mrow><mi>u</mi><mi>v</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta_{uv}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">uv</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（Duv）描述与轨迹的偏离：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mrow><mi>u</mi><mi>v</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta_{uv}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">uv</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 值</th>\n<th>偏移方向</th>\n<th>视觉效果</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>+</mo><mn>0.005</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">+0.005</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">+</span><span class=\"mord\">0.005</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>偏绿</td>\n<td>荧光灯绿偏</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>在轨迹上</td>\n<td>纯色温</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>0.005</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">-0.005</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\">0.005</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>偏品红</td>\n<td>某些LED偏品</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"常见光源色温表\">常见光源色温表</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>光源类型</th>\n<th>色温范围 (K)</th>\n<th>光谱类型</th>\n<th>CRI</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>蜡烛</td>\n<td>1800-1900</td>\n<td>连续（黑体近似）</td>\n<td>100</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>日出/日落</td>\n<td>2000-3000</td>\n<td>连续（大气散射）</td>\n<td>~100</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>白炽灯</td>\n<td>2700-2800</td>\n<td>连续</td>\n<td>100</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>卤素灯</td>\n<td>3000-3400</td>\n<td>连续</td>\n<td>~100</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>暖白 LED</td>\n<td>2700-3000</td>\n<td>蓝峰+宽带</td>\n<td>80-97</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>中性白 LED</td>\n<td>4000-4500</td>\n<td>蓝峰+宽带</td>\n<td>80-95</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>正午日光</td>\n<td>5200-5800</td>\n<td>连续</td>\n<td>100</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>闪光灯</td>\n<td>5400-5600</td>\n<td>近似日光</td>\n<td>90-95</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>阴天</td>\n<td>6000-7000</td>\n<td>连续（蓝偏）</td>\n<td>~100</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>阴影（蓝天照射）</td>\n<td>7000-9000</td>\n<td>短波散射主导</td>\n<td>—</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>冷白荧光灯</td>\n<td>4000-4500</td>\n<td>线状+荧光</td>\n<td>60-85</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>三基色荧光灯</td>\n<td>各色温可调</td>\n<td>三窄带</td>\n<td>80-90</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"色温感知与摄影应用\">色温感知与摄影应用</h2><h3 id=\"色温适应-chromatic-adaptation\">色温适应（Chromatic Adaptation）</h3><p>人眼具有强大的色温适应能力——在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3000</mn><mi>K</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3000K</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3000</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span></span></span></span></span> 的灯下待一会儿，白纸仍然看起来是白的。但相机没有这种能力——它忠实记录实际色温差异：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>人眼适应时间</mtext><mo>≈</mo><mn>20</mn><mtext>–</mtext><mn>60</mn><mtext> 秒完成 </mtext><mn>80</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi><mtext> 适应</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{人眼适应时间} \\approx 20–60 \\text{ 秒完成 } 80\\% \\text{ 适应}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">人眼适应时间</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">20–60</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">秒完成</span><span class=\"mord\"> </span></span><span class=\"mord\">80%</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">适应</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>场景</th>\n<th>人眼感知</th>\n<th>相机记录（未校正）</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>钨丝灯下白纸</td>\n<td>白色</td>\n<td>橙黄色</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>阴影中白纸</td>\n<td>白色</td>\n<td>蓝色</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>混合光源</td>\n<td>部分适应主光源</td>\n<td>两种色温同时可见</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"色温作为创意工具\">色温作为创意工具</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>设置策略</th>\n<th>效果</th>\n<th>应用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>精确匹配场景色温</td>\n<td>中性、真实</td>\n<td>产品摄影、纪实</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>比场景暖 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>500</mn><mi>K</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">500K</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">500</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>温暖、怀旧</td>\n<td>人像、美食</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>比场景冷 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>500</mn><mi>K</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">500K</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">500</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>清冷、疏离</td>\n<td>风景、建筑</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>极端偏移</td>\n<td>强烈色调风格化</td>\n<td>艺术创作</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"光源的显色性\">光源的显色性</h2><h3 id=\"cri-与-tm-30\">CRI 与 TM-30</h3><p>CRI（显色指数）衡量光源对标准色样的还原能力：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>CRI</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>8</mn></mfrac><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>8</mn></munderover><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>100</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>4.6</mn><mo>×</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><msub><mi>E</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{CRI} = \\frac{1}{8}\\sum_{i=1}^{8} R_i, \\quad R_i = 100 - 4.6 \\times \\Delta E_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">CRI</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3.0788em;vertical-align:-1.2777em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">8</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.8011em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.3em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">8</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">100</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-