\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">60</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>差</td>\n<td>钠灯、低端LED</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>TM-30-20 是更先进的评价标准，增加了色域面积（Gamut Area）和保真度（Fidelity）分量：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>指标</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>理想值</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>f</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R_f</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>保真度</td>\n<td>100</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>g</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R_g</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>色域面积</td>\n<td>100 (不过大也不过小)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>色向量图</td>\n<td>16 色相的偏移方向</td>\n<td>全部指向中心</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"摄影用光源选择\">摄影用光源选择</h2><h3 id=\"2025-2026-主流灯光\">2025-2026 主流灯光</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>灯光类型</th>\n<th>色温</th>\n<th>CRI/TLCI</th>\n<th>适用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Aputure 600d Pro</td>\n<td>5600K</td>\n<td>CRI 96+</td>\n<td>高端影视</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Godox SL-300 III</td>\n<td>5600K</td>\n<td>CRI 96</td>\n<td>中端通用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Nanlite Forza 720B</td>\n<td>2700-6500K 双色温</td>\n<td>CRI 98</td>\n<td>全场景</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Amaran F22x</td>\n<td>2500-7500K</td>\n<td>CRI 95</td>\n<td>柔光面板</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>RGB 灯 (Aputure MC Pro)</td>\n<td>全色域</td>\n<td>CRI 95+ (白光)</td>\n<td>创意色彩</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"总结\">总结</h2><p>色温是理解和控制光线颜色的物理工具。在摄影中，它既是需要&quot;校正&quot;的技术参数，也是可以&quot;利用&quot;的创意维度。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>知识点</th>\n<th>核心内容</th>\n<th>摄影意义</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>黑体辐射</td>\n<td>温度→光谱→颜色</td>\n<td>色温的物理基础</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CCT &amp; Duv</td>\n<td>色温 + 绿紫偏移</td>\n<td>完整描述光源色彩</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>色温表</td>\n<td>各光源对应值</td>\n<td>白平衡设定参考</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CRI/TM-30</td>\n<td>显色能力评价</td>\n<td>光源选购/肤色还原</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>人眼适应</td>\n<td>自动补偿 vs 相机不补偿</td>\n<td>白平衡必要性</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n","headings":[{"level":1